<library>
<description>&lt;b&gt;PJ-327A 3.5mm Stereo Audio Jack SMD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Libreria para conector Jack de audio 3.5mm SMD hembra de 4 contactos.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contactos:&lt;/b&gt; Pines SMD 2, 3, 4, 5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dimensiones del cuerpo:&lt;/b&gt; 12.1 mm x 6.1 mm x 5.0 mm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cuello frontal:&lt;/b&gt; Diametro 5.6 mm, sobresale 2.0 mm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Orificio de insercion:&lt;/b&gt; Diametro 3.6 mm (Plug estandard 3.5mm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Postes de centrado:&lt;/b&gt; 2 agujeros guia Diametro 1.5 mm (separacion 7.0 mm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rating:&lt;/b&gt; 0.3A 30V DC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
<packages>
<package name="PJ-327A_SMD">
<description>&lt;b&gt;PJ-327A SMD (Conector Jack 3.5mm)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Cuerpo: 12.1 x 6.1 mm (alto 5.0 mm).&lt;br&gt;
Postes guía: 2 x Diametro 1.5 mm a X=1.6 mm y X=8.6 mm en Y=0.&lt;br&gt;
Pads SMD: 1.4 mm x 2.5 mm.&lt;br&gt;
Pad 2: X=3.2 mm, Y=+3.25 mm&lt;br&gt;
Pad 3: X=6.2 mm, Y=+3.25 mm&lt;br&gt;
Pad 4: X=10.2 mm, Y=+3.25 mm&lt;br&gt;
Pad 5: X=11.3 mm, Y=-3.25 mm&lt;br&gt;
Origen (0,0) en la cara frontal del cuerpo plástico sobre el eje central.</description>
<smd name="2" x="3.2" y="3.25" dx="1.4" dy="2.5" layer="1" roundness="15"/>
<smd name="3" x="6.2" y="3.25" dx="1.4" dy="2.5" layer="1" roundness="15"/>
